- `sphere_s()` handles the 4-point case (minimum enclosing sphere is determined by 4 points)
- `welzl()` is the main recursive function with randomized shuffling for expected O(n) time complexity
- `solution()` parses the input and runs the algorithm, outputting centers with 10 decimal places

