The key insight is to check a few conditions:
1. Fixed "N" positions shouldn't already create consecutive runs longer than k
2. If we set all "?" to "Y", the maximum consecutive N should be ≤ k (otherwise impossible)
3. If we set all "?" to "N", the maximum consecutive N should be ≥ k (otherwise we can't reach k)

